{"path":"thread/shared_lock/unlock","title":"std::shared_lock<Mutex>::unlock","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::shared_lock&lt;Mutex&gt;::</span>unlock","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/shared_lock/unlock","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Unlocks the associated mutex from shared mode. Effectively calls mutex()->unlock_shared().","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx14\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> unlock<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(since C++14)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Unlocks the associated mutex from shared mode. Effectively calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">mutex<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>unlock_shared<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p><p><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/system_error\">std::system_error</a></span> is thrown if there is no associated mutex or if the mutex is not locked.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<ul><li> Any exceptions thrown by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">mutex<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>unlock_shared<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li> If there is no associated mutex, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/system_error\">std::system_error</a></span> with an error code of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/errc\">std::errc::operation_not_permitted</a></span>.\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/shared_lock/lock\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>lock</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  locks the associated mutex <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/shared_lock/release\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>release</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  disassociates the mutex without unlocking <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"},{"path":"thread/shared_lock","title":"std::shared_lock"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::shared_lock<Mutex>::unlock","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++14. Unlocks the associated mutex from shared mode. Effectively calls mutex()->unlock_shared()."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Exceptions"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"lock","note":"locks the associated mutex"},{"label":"release","note":"disassociates the mutex without unlocking"}]}]},"standards":["C++14"],"wordCount":80,"codeBlockCount":0}
